| `Echo` passes whatever `value` was handed in through unchanged, including
| nested Array/Object — the handler that shares structure with its input
| rather than building something fresh. Inherited from `test_math` by the
| same split as `Shout`.
link "native_modules/strings.so" as s
emit Echo { value = { tag = "x", nums = [1, 2, 3] } } to s get n
assert n = { _class = "EchoResult", value = { tag = "x", nums = [1, 2, 3] } }
